- **Industrial Automation:** Real-time GUI dashboards for SCADA systems.
- **Banking Software:** Button-driven transaction UIs.
- **Educational Software:** Interactive simulations, drag-and-drop puzzles.
- **Embedded IDEs:** Code editors (key events for autocomplete, mouse events for selection).

