**(a)** Explain the `MouseListener` and `MouseMotionListener` interfaces with their methods. Write a program to display the current mouse coordinates in a `JLabel` as the mouse moves over a `JPanel`. **(7 marks)**

**(b)** Differentiate between `KeyPressed()`, `KeyReleased()`, and `KeyTyped()` methods of `KeyListener`. Write a Java Swing program to detect when the **Enter** key is pressed in a `JTextField` and transfer focus to another component. **(7 marks)**

