## 5. KTU 2024 Scheme Examination Question Bank & Topic Recap

### 5.1 Part A — Short Answer Questions (3 Marks Each)

**Q1. [KTU University Exam – May 2024]**
*What is JDBC? List any four key interfaces of the `java.sql` package.*

**Model Answer (3 Marks):**

JDBC (Java Database Connectivity) is a Java API that enables Java applications to communicate with relational databases using SQL queries, providing database-independent connectivity through vendor-specific drivers.

Four key interfaces of `java.sql`:

1. **`DriverManager`** — Manages database drivers and creates `Connection` objects.
2. **`Connection`** — Represents an active session between Java program and database.
3. **`Statement` / `PreparedStatement`** — Used to execute SQL queries.
4. **`ResultSet`** — Represents the tabular result of a `SELECT` query.

*(Award ½ mark for definition + ½ mark each for four interfaces = 3 marks.)*

